Collisions Layer that acts 2-fold:

    1. Indicator for drawing layers:
        Layers beneath it render beneath the game objects (players, npcs, etc)
        Layers above it will render above the game objects (foreground layer)
    2. Pack smaller collision areas to larger collision areas (instead of hundreds of individual tiles) - map packing concept

    resources: [https://youtu.be/k3262rez2wy?t=235&si=laqfyoig3hgst6oh]



